# Cisco Duo signed-request credentials (Duo Auth Signature v5, HMAC-SHA512).
# ikey identifies the integration; skey is the HMAC signing secret and is
# bearer-equivalent for this integration's admin scope - treat it like any
# other stored secret. apiHost is this account's per-customer Duo API
# hostname (e.g. api-xxxxxxxx.duosecurity.com), not secret.
DUO_IKEY=
DUO_SKEY=
DUO_API_HOST=
